Hi Matt,

The obvious comment to make is with regards to your query is
that it isn't a ggplot query, you haven't got to the stage
of plotting anything, and so this is not the right forum.

I would suggest the R-help mailing list, or contacting the
maintainer of the package that mle2 comes from.

But either way, the information that you provided is insufficient
to help people to help you. A reproducible example (not necessarily
using all of your data, or even real data) that shows the problem
would help wherever you ask the question - something that is
cut and pastable into R. See, for example, here:
https://community.rstudio.com/t/faq-whats-a-reproducible-example-reprex-and-how-do-i-do-one/5219

Regards,
Ron.

