It seems this has something to do with ICU4C - on the Rocks Cluster I can only go up to "50.1.2-15.el7.x86_64" and what is needed is ICU4C >= 52 library.
This is just one of the few dependencies which I need to fix before install.packages("tidyverse") will work.

I have seen this before but that was solved by using old version of packages which were compatible with old versions of dependencies.
Anyways to look at similar solution here? Is there a set of "tidyverse" which could be compatible with ICU4C - 50.1.2-15?

